# Exclude non-deployment files from Vercel CLI uploads
data/*
!data/episodes/
!backend/data/
Documents/
reviews/
docs/
.agent/
*.md
!README.md
# Exclude generated images from upload: variant dirs (UUIDs) AND accumulated
# top-level winner PNGs (~87MB of local runtime artifacts — canonical copies
# live in Vercel Blob; on Lambda the art director writes to /tmp, never here).
# Keep only the seed-recipe .webp files, which src/seed_recipes.json serves
# statically at /assets/images/<slug>.webp. Without this, the Python function
# bundle blows the 225MB Vercel cap (failed deploy 2026-07-16, 288MB).
src/assets/images/*
!src/assets/images/*.webp
# scripts/ is developer tooling and stays out of the bundle — EXCEPT the
# modules backend/ imports at runtime. Anything listed in a `from scripts.X
# import ...` inside backend/ MUST have a `!scripts/X.py` line here, or the
# import raises ModuleNotFoundError in the Lambda and only in the Lambda.
# tests/test_vercel_bundle.py enforces that. pick_concept.py was missing for
# months: every production Monday fell through to the placeholder concept
# with the catalog-aware duplicate check switched off (#6855).
scripts/*
!scripts/simulate_dialogue_week.py
!scripts/pick_concept.py
!scripts/__init__.py
tests/
.grepai/
.claude/

# SEO crawl exports: reference data, never served. Grows ~80KB/week and the
# Python bundle sits against a 225MB Vercel cap.
seo-audits/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only artifacts. .vercelignore is a SEPARATE list from .gitignore —
# "gitignored" does NOT mean "not uploaded". Without these lines the CLI
# uploaded 613MB of developer junk on every deploy and the function bundle hit
# 277.52MB against a 225MB cap (measured 2026-09-05, card #6868).
#
# .scratch/ matters beyond size: the locked hygiene contract promises files
# there "never reach a PR", which is a statement about git only. Nothing else
# kept scratch content out of a third-party upload.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.scratch/
.venv/
venv/
.vercel/
node_modules/
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
